# Script: P1 activates Aphrodite or Astarte, P2 Tanit, whenever they can; a player holding a Mythology token builds its
# Grand Temple (free, R9). Every other take-card turn discards the first accessible card (2 coins: nobody builds a yellow card). Reveals come from RandomChanceSource(19); other decisions take the first legal Move.
